      <activity id="3d2f5942-74a6-54f6-bd86-22d7242a4c37" activityNameId="095f74f9-251d-5afa-9e42-ad55bdc552c0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, silencer for ventilator unit 1800 m3/h, modular, Device</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, silencer for ventilator unit 1800 m3/h, modular, Device
Disposal of a silencer for a air handling unit with 1800 m3/h nominal air flow rate (at 2 m/s air speed in cross section of air filter or heat exchanger), total weight: 90 kg/Unit, including a frame construction, casing, silencer baffle with section length 900mm. The frame construction made of aluminium-profiles, casing made of hot-dip galvanized and powder coated steel sheets insulated with polyurethane foam, rock wool as sound-absorbing media.;
UUID: 25fbcb5a-0489-43f4-9628-74a1081c3a4a
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_25fbcb5a-0489-43f4-9628-74a1081c3a4a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
